    {
      "source": "<code>SpringRepeat</code> is a custom JUnit <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a> which adds support\nfor Spring's <a href=\"../../../annotation/Repeat.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.annotation\"><code>@Repeat</code></a>\nannotation by repeating the test the specified number of times.",
      "translation": "<code>SpringRepeat</code> 是一个自定义的 JUnit <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a>，它通过按指定次数重复测试来支持 Spring 的 <a href=\"../../../annotation/Repeat.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.annotation\"><code>@Repeat</code></a> 注解。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Construct a new <code>SpringRepeat</code> statement for the supplied\n<code>testMethod</code>, retrieving the configured repeat count from the\n<code>@Repeat</code> annotation on the supplied method.",
      "translation": "为提供的 `testMethod` 构建一个新的 `<code>SpringRepeat</code>` 语句，从提供的方法上的 `<code>@Repeat</code>` 注解中获取配置的重复次数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Construct a new <code>SpringRepeat</code> statement for the supplied\n<code>testMethod</code> and <code>repeat</code> count.",
      "translation": "为提供的 `<code>testMethod</code>` 和 `<code>repeat</code>` 计数构建一个新的 `<code>SpringRepeat</code>` 语句。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Evaluate the next <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>statement</code></a> in the execution chain\nrepeatedly, using the specified repeat count.",
      "translation": "反复评估执行链中的下一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>statement</code></a>，使用指定的重复次数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>next</code> - the next <code>Statement</code> in the execution chain",
      "translation": "<code>next</code> - 执行链中的下一个 <code>Statement</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>testMethod</code> - the current test method",
      "translation": "<code>testMethod</code> - 当前测试方法",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>repeat</code> - the configured repeat count for the current test method",
      "translation": "<code>repeat</code> - 当前测试方法的配置重复次数",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "since Spring Framework 7.0 in favor of the\n<a href=\"../../junit/jupiter/SpringExtension.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit.jupiter\"><code>SpringExtension</code></a>\nand JUnit Jupiter",
      "translation": "自 Spring Framework 7.0 起，推荐使用\n<a href=\"../../junit/jupiter/SpringExtension.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit.jupiter\"><code>SpringExtension</code></a>\n和 JUnit Jupiter。",
      "count": 1
